            "fontSize": 20,
            "fontFamily": 3,
            "text": "Analyze AI's suggestions:\n \n* If you keep the ideas exactly, \n  color-code them green by dragging / resizing \n  the boxes below over the text\n\n* Color-code the text blue for AI ideas that you \n  revise or edit\n\n* Color-code the text red for ideas that you \n  reject as too fake or biased.",
